---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import TopicCard from '../components/TopicCard.astro';
import { topics } from '../data/topics';
---
<Layout>
  <section class="shell hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> 校園生活，正在解鎖 <span class="version">V0.1</span></p>
      <h1>欸，今天<br />要幹嘛<span class="question">？</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">大學生活，別只剩下課表。</p>
      <p class="hero-description">活動、社團，還有那些想一起做的事。<br class="desktop-break" />這裡是學生自己的校園生活提案，從亞東開始。</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/aeust-life/explore/">找點事做 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/aeust-life/about/">先認識一下 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
      <p class="hero-note"><span aria-hidden="true">↳</span> 學生自主發起 · 非官方 · 一起慢慢長大</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-label="課表之外的生活：探索、交朋友、試點新鮮事">
      <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
      <span class="art-star star-one" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
      <div class="note-ticket"><div class="ticket-top mono">AEUST LIFE <span>ADMIT YOU</span></div><div class="ticket-main"><span>你的大學生活</span><strong>不只一種<br />打開方式。</strong><span class="ticket-smile" aria-hidden="true">☺</span></div><div class="ticket-bottom"><span class="mono">NO. 001 — START HERE</span><span class="barcode" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></div>
      <div class="sticker sticker-lime">下課了，<br />然後呢？<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
      <div class="sticker sticker-purple">一起去<br /><strong>試試看！</strong></div>
      <div class="art-caption mono">LESS SCROLLING.<br />MORE LIVING.</div>
      <span class="art-star star-two" aria-hidden="true">✧</span>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="life-strip" aria-hidden="true"><span>課表之外</span><b>✳</b><span>找到同頻的人</span><b>✳</b><span>留一點時間給好奇</span><b>✳</b><span>MAKE ROOM FOR LIFE</span><b>✳</b></div>
  <section class="shell section" aria-labelledby="explore-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / EXPLORE YOUR CAMPUS</p><h2 id="explore-title">生活，往這邊走<span class="orange-text">↘</span></h2></div><p>先挑一個你有興趣的。<br />這些可能，正在一步一步變成真的。</p></div>
    <div class="topic-grid">{topics.map(topic => <TopicCard topic={topic} />)}</div>
    <p class="small-note">社團指南已提供官方資料整理；其他主題正逐步準備中，目前尚未開放活動投稿、揪團或交易。</p>
  </section>
  <section class="progress-section"><div class="shell progress-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / BUILDING IN PUBLIC</p><h2>還在施工，<br />但想先讓你看看。</h2><p>不等到什麼都完美才開始。<br />從一個小小的想法，慢慢做成大家用得上的地方。</p><a class="text-link" href="/aeust-life/roadmap/">看看我們走到哪了 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="progress-list"><article><span class="status-pill done">已完成</span><h3>校園生活的第一個入口</h3><p>探索頁、專案介紹與公開開發路線。</p></article><article><span class="status-pill done">已完成</span><h3>把你的想法，留在這裡</h3><p>匿名回饋表單與儲存 API；公開服務仍待部署。</p></article><article><span class="status-pill planned">下一步</span><h3>先從真實的活動資訊開始</h3><p>確認資訊來源，再設計投稿與審核流程。</p></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="shell section"><div class="feedback-banner"><span class="banner-doodle" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><div><p class="eyebrow">THIS IS YOUR CAMPUS, TOO.</p><h2>「如果有這個就好了⋯」</h2><p>你腦中那個想法，也許就是 AEUST Life 的下一步。</p></div><a class="button dark" href="/aeust-life/feedback/">說來聽聽 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</Layout>
